{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423280/extras/85bbe4c143cb65f5328b0ac661fcdb91.poster.avif?t=1772466382\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423280/extras/85bbe4c143cb65f5328b0ac661fcdb91.webm?t=1772466382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423280/extras/85bbe4c143cb65f5328b0ac661fcdb91.mp4?t=1772466382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>In this immersive roguelite, play as Henry Barrington and set sail on a makeshift pirate ship.</strong> Your quest for redemption and wealth will take you to the far reaches of this cursed Caribbean region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423280/extras/234ae498793874db85c6790f36b25c0e.avif?t=1772466382\" width=616 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423280/extras/9191c6a561c821774da559c8f0ea7f09.poster.avif?t=1772466382\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423280/extras/9191c6a561c821774da559c8f0ea7f09.webm?t=1772466382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423280/extras/9191c6a561c821774da559c8f0ea7f09.mp4?t=1772466382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dive into the depths to collect valuable resources and equipment, then resurface to face waves of ever more fearsome enemies.</strong>\u00a0And above all, upgrade and repair your pirate ship to explore even further!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423280/extras/bbc6adc1910bd9204f5b4d653996cbfd.avif?t=1772466382\" width=616 height=148 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423280/extras/ff8822d8e9d590f7dfd41a58dcfac6be.poster.avif?t=1772466382\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423280/extras/ff8822d8e9d590f7dfd41a58dcfac6be.webm?t=1772466382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423280/extras/ff8822d8e9d590f7dfd41a58dcfac6be.mp4?t=1772466382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Meet colorful characters!</strong> But who is that old hermit on his island? Hmmm... This adventure might turn out to be far more dangerous than it seems...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423280/extras/e06226fb44ab53eb01a901c6b97faa55.avif?t=1772466382\" width=616 height=148 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423280/extras/7d8c5f89b4124e63b0babc4a71d56a14.poster.avif?t=1772466382\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423280/extras/7d8c5f89b4124e63b0babc4a71d56a14.webm?t=1772466382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423280/extras/7d8c5f89b4124e63b0babc4a71d56a14.mp4?t=1772466382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Gather precious relics... but beware of curses</strong> <strong>that could lead to your downfall. Yet death is not the end!</strong> Keep returning to the mysterious island of Iticali and set sail again to reclaim your former pirate glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423280/extras/c2ee4488ac0bddbc4281890668584792.avif?t=1772466382\" width=616 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>An accessible roguelite at the heart of a thrilling pirate universe.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Explore the ocean depths and progress ever further.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Surface battles blending reflexes and strategy.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Numerous gadgets and upgrades to vary your approach.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Dozens of unique relics and curses that will shake up every run.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hand-drawn illustrations and a rich, immersive soundtrack.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><i>- </i>With the support of the \u00cele-de-France Region<i> -</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackg